sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Approver
  participant UI as Browser app.js [E1]
  participant MW as SessionAuthMiddleware [E4]
  participant SS as SessionStore [E5]
  participant RR as RequireRole filter [E6]
  participant AC as ApprovalsController.Approve [E9]
  participant H as ApiControllerBase.Handle [E10]
  participant AS as ApprovalService.Approve [E11]
  participant R as InMemoryInvoiceRepository [E13]

  U->>UI: click Approve [E1 decide()]
  UI->>MW: POST /api/approvals/{id}/approve, Authorization Bearer token
  MW->>SS: Get(token)
  SS-->>MW: UserSession(Username, Role)
  Note over MW: no session gives 401, otherwise the session is stored in HttpContext.Items
  MW->>RR: next(context), MVC routes to action
  Note over RR: role not in Approver/Admin gives 403 before the action runs
  RR->>AC: OnActionExecuting passes
  AC->>H: Handle(() => Approve(id, session.Username))
  H->>AS: Approve(invoiceId, approver)
  AS->>R: GetById(id) [lock]
  R-->>AS: the stored Invoice object (same reference)
  Note over AS: EnsurePending: throws InvalidOperationException unless PendingApproval
  AS->>AS: set Status=Approved, DecidedBy, DecidedAt (mutates the stored object)
  AS->>R: Update(invoice) [lock]
  AS-->>H: Invoice
  H-->>AC: Ok(invoice)
  AC-->>UI: 200 JSON invoice
  Note over H: KeyNotFound gives 404, InvalidOperation gives 409, Argument gives 400
  UI->>UI: refresh() reloads GET /api/invoices
